  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The equivalent circuit of the given configuration can be drawn as follows:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f56dad99-58be-4d04-b41a-4d678242a72b.png\" style=\"width: 662px; height: 103px;\" /></p><p>With reference to the above diagram, the equivalent resistance of the given configuration can be calculated as follows:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>",
